<view class="screen">
  <text class="eyebrow">留一点时间 · 给重要的小事</text>
  <text class="page-title">{{id ? '编辑提醒任务' : '新建提醒任务'}}</text>
  <text class="page-subtitle">填写对象和时间，保存后再选择提醒方式。</text>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在读取…</view>
  <view wx:elif="{{unavailable}}" class="notice section-space">暂时无法编辑，请返回清单后重试。</view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view wx:if="{{copying}}" class="notice section-space">已复制原任务的周期、时间和文案。请填写新对象名称，原任务不会被修改。</view>
    <view class="form-section"><text class="field-label">选择平台</text><view class="row platform-options"><view class="platform-option {{type === 'douyin' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-type="douyin" bindtap="onType"><text class="platform-symbol">✦</text><text>抖音续火花</text><text class="option-check">{{type === 'douyin' ? '✓' : ''}}</text></view><view class="platform-option {{type === 'weibo' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-type="weibo" bindtap="onType"><text class="platform-symbol orange">◎</text><text>微博打卡</text><text class="option-check">{{type === 'weibo' ? '✓' : ''}}</text></view></view><text wx:if="{{errors.type}}" class="error">{{errors.type}}</text></view>
    <view class="form-section"><text class="field-label">{{type === 'douyin' ? '好友备注' : '打卡目标'}}</text><input class="field-input" value="{{name}}" placeholder="{{type === 'douyin' ? '例如：小林' : '例如：每天去喜欢的超话签到'}}" maxlength="40" data-field="name" bindinput="onInput" /><text wx:if="{{errors.name}}" class="error">{{errors.name}}</text><text class="field-tip">用自己熟悉的名字即可，不需要账号或密码。</text></view>
    <view class="form-section"><text class="field-label">希望提醒的时间</text><picker mode="time" value="{{time}}" bindchange="onTime"><view class="field-input row between"><text class="time-value">{{time}}</text><text class="time-unit">选择时间 <text class="chevron">›</text></text></view></picker><text wx:if="{{errors.time}}" class="error">{{errors.time}}</text><text class="field-tip">保存后可在详情添加日历提醒。微信消息需要单独授权；修改时间后，请同步检查已添加的日历事项。</text></view>
    <view class="form-section"><text class="field-label">重复周期（北京时间）</text><view class="repeat-options row"><button class="{{repeat === 'daily' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-repeat="daily" bindtap="onRepeat">每天</button><button class="{{repeat === 'weekdays' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-repeat="weekdays" bindtap="onRepeat">周一至周五</button><button class="{{repeat === 'custom' ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-repeat="custom" bindtap="onRepeat">自选星期</button></view><view wx:if="{{repeat === 'custom'}}" class="week-options"><button wx:for="{{weekOptions}}" wx:key="day" class="{{item.selected ? 'selected' : ''}}" data-day="{{item.day}}" bindtap="onWeekDay">{{item.label}}</button></view><text wx:if="{{errors.repeat}}" class="error">{{errors.repeat}}</text><text class="field-tip">“周一至周五”不按法定节假日调休。</text></view>
    <view class="card enabled-card row between"><view class="grow"><view class="enabled-title">重要对象置顶</view><text class="field-tip">未确认任务中优先显示</text></view><switch checked="{{pinned}}" color="#37634a" bindchange="onPinned" /></view>
    <view class="form-section"><text class="field-label">备注 <text class="optional">选填</text></text><textarea class="field-input field-textarea note-area" value="{{note}}" placeholder="例如：晚饭后记得来看看" maxlength="200" data-field="note" bindinput="onInput" /><text wx:if="{{errors.note}}" class="error">{{errors.note}}</text></view>
    <view class="form-section"><text class="field-label">快捷复制文案 <text class="optional">选填</text></text><textarea class="field-input field-textarea" value="{{greeting}}" placeholder="写下一句想说的话，详情页可一键复制" maxlength="200" data-field="greeting" bindinput="onInput" /><text wx:if="{{errors.greeting}}" class="error">{{errors.greeting}}</text><text class="field-tip">复制后需要你到对应平台粘贴、发送或完成打卡。</text></view>
    <view class="card enabled-card row between"><view class="grow"><view class="enabled-title">启用此任务</view><text class="field-tip">开启后按周期进入今日清单</text></view><switch checked="{{enabled}}" color="#37634a" bindchange="onEnabled" /></view>
    <view class="actions"><button class="primary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="onSave">{{id ? '保存修改' : '保存，选择提醒方式'}}</button><text class="button-caption">保存清单不会自动开启通知，也不会代发消息。</text></view>
  </block>
</view>
